question.en:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instruction:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify the assumptions that must hold for the statement to be valid, then choose the correct option. Statement: The discovery of exoplanets in habitable zones around distant stars has provided exciting prospects for the search for extraterrestrial life, yet the vast distances and technological limitations pose significant obstacles to direct exploration.&lt;/p&gt;

